    "doc_text": "XIN_ENG_20061129.0110\n\nBERLIN, Nov. 29 , 2006 (Xinhua)\n\nMajor German stocks open higher\n\n\n\n\nGerman stocks opened higher Wednesday on the Frankfurt market.\n\nThe 30-share DAX Index climbed 0.44 percent to 6,309 points.\n\nThe TecDAX index of technologies and science firms gained 0.92 percent to 686 points.",
